# Grid B — U11 Locate by role (uniqueness claim)
#
# Gap target: "which function is the SINGLE producer of X" is a
# uniqueness lookup — stronger than "who sets X". No axis forces
# the pipeline to verify uniqueness (grep can count). This case
# measures the failure mode where the LLM names one producer and
# claims uniqueness without counting.
#
# Ground truth (grep-verified against HEAD on 2026-05-12):
# CitationReq.Required = false has exactly four production call
# sites. A correct answer must name both the files AND the count.
ID="u11b"
NAME="locate by role — single producer of CitationReq.Required=false"
QUESTION="本仓库里，把 CitationReq.Required 设置为 false 的生产代码位点一共有几处？在哪个文件？给出文件路径和行号。"
# 2026-05-12 spec refresh: re-verified ground truth via
# `grep -rnE 'CitationReq\.Required\s*=\s*false|CitationReq\{[^}]*Required:\s*false' --include='*.go' .`
# filtered for production code (excludes _test.go and comments):
#   1) internal/agent/analyzer.go:1903
#      out.AnswerContract.CitationReq.Required = false
#      (measurement-scalar / history-lookup carve-out in buildAnalysisIR)
#   2) internal/orchestrator/contract_check.go:63
#      c.CitationReq.Required = false
#      (runtime artifact citation-floor waiver in runContractCheck)
#   3) internal/orchestrator/orchestrator.go:6362
#      CitationReq: types.CitationReq{Required: false}
#      (buildDegradedFallbackIR — degraded-path waiver)
#   4) internal/orchestrator/orchestrator.go:6494
#      CitationReq: types.CitationReq{Required: false}
#      (buildDegradedSemanticIR — degraded-semantic-recovery waiver)
#
# So the truth is 4 production sites. Strict-bar requires answer
# to surface BOTH file paths AND the count (4/四).
#
# History:
# - 2026-05-04 spec said 2 (orchestrator + analyzer); the two
#   degraded-IR paths were added later (commits 2189151 / e502fd9)
#   so the second orchestrator site appeared, taking the count to 3.
# - 2026-05-12 spec added contract_check.go:63 as a production
#   runtime waiver assignment; previous strict bar under-counted the
#   current repository by ignoring that production code path.
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyzer.go orchestrator.go contract_check.go"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="\b(4|四)\b
internal/agent/analyzer\.go
internal/orchestrator/contract_check\.go
internal/orchestrator/orchestrator\.go"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="multiple.places several.places many.places"
